<title>THAILAND: Thai Stanley 1996/97 net profit lower.</title>
<headline>Thai Stanley 1996/97 net profit lower.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to January 31, 1997.</p>
<p>			  (million baht unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)		6.31	vs		9.81</p>
